WEBVTT

00:02.210 --> 00:03.169
Are you ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:03.253 --> 00:05.004
All: Aye, aye, Captain!
全体：是啊是啊，队长！

00:05.088 --> 00:06.381
I can't hear you.
我听不到你说话。

00:06.464 --> 00:08.425
All: Aye, aye, Captain!
全体：是啊是啊，队长！

00:08.508 --> 00:11.636
♪ Ohh... ♪
♪ 哦...♪

00:11.720 --> 00:13.596
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:13.680 --> 00:15.849
All: Spongebob Squarepants!
全部：海绵宝宝！

00:15.932 --> 00:17.559
♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:17.642 --> 00:19.561
All: Spongebob Squarepants!
全部：海绵宝宝！

00:19.644 --> 00:21.688
♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
♪ 如果是航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:21.771 --> 00:23.690
All: Spongebob Squarepants!
全部：海绵宝宝！

00:23.773 --> 00:25.817
♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:25.900 --> 00:27.569
-All: Spongebob Squarepants!
-Ready?
-全部：海绵宝宝！
-准备好？

00:27.652 --> 00:29.863
All: Spongebob Squarepants!
全部：海绵宝宝！

00:29.946 --> 00:31.573
Spongebob Squarepants!
海绵宝宝！

00:31.656 --> 00:33.700
Spongebob Squarepants!
海绵宝宝！

00:33.783 --> 00:34.951
Spongebob
海绵宝宝

00:35.034 --> 00:37.203
Squarepants!
方裤！

