01:01.936 --> 01:03.521
Oh, Neptune,
哦，海王星，

01:03.605 --> 01:06.274
surely this isn't the behavior
befitting a king,
这肯定不是行为
适合国王，

01:06.357 --> 01:08.902
hiding in bed for days on end,
连续几天躲在床上，

01:08.985 --> 01:12.947
doing nothing but watching
daytime television.
除了观看什么也不做
白天的电视。

01:13.031 --> 01:14.657
Wait!
等待！

01:14.741 --> 01:17.786
Rochelle was just about to meet
her biological parents.
罗谢尔正要见面
她的亲生父母。

01:17.869 --> 01:20.413
Is this about
turning 5,000 today?
这是关于
今天就满 5000 岁了吗？

01:20.497 --> 01:21.706
No.
不。

01:21.790 --> 01:23.666
Oh, my darling Amphitrite,
哦，我亲爱的安菲特里忒，

01:23.750 --> 01:26.586
it is not my age
that troubles me so.
这不是我的年龄
这让我很困扰。

01:26.669 --> 01:28.880
It is that our son, Triton,
will not be able to share
这是我们的儿子特里顿，
将无法分享

01:28.963 --> 01:30.548
in my revelry.
在我的狂欢中。

01:30.632 --> 01:33.551
Let's forget about Triton
for just one day.
让我们忘记特里顿吧
就一天。

01:33.635 --> 01:37.263
It's your 5,000th birthday,
for shell's sake.
今天是你的 5000 岁生日，
为了壳的缘故。

01:38.389 --> 01:39.933
Okay.
好的。

01:40.016 --> 01:41.559
So long as there's no one
careless enough
只要没有人
够粗心的

01:41.643 --> 01:44.062
to mention Triton.
不得不提的是海卫一。

01:44.145 --> 01:47.649
Order up, Squidward!
下令吧，章鱼哥！

01:47.732 --> 01:49.776
I bet you're wondering why
I'm not using my hands today.
我打赌你想知道为什么
我今天没有用手。

01:49.859 --> 01:51.820
Not in the least, Spongebob.
一点也不，海绵宝宝。

01:51.903 --> 01:53.238
Okay, okay.
I'll tell you.
好吧，好吧。
我告诉你。

01:53.321 --> 01:55.281
Your order, ma'am.
您的命令，女士。

01:55.365 --> 01:57.283
I'm not using my hands
because today
我没有用我的手
因为今天

01:57.367 --> 01:59.577
is work without your hands day.
是没有双手的工作日。

01:59.661 --> 02:01.454
You should give it a whirl,
buddy.
你应该尝试一下，
伙计。

02:07.544 --> 02:10.171
Krusty Krab,
Spongebob speaking.
蟹堡王,
海绵宝宝在说话。

02:10.255 --> 02:11.714
Just a minute, please.
请稍等一下。

02:11.798 --> 02:13.675
Mr. Krabs,
it's a Queen Amphitrite.
蟹老板先生，
这是安菲特里忒女王。

02:13.758 --> 02:15.093
She wants to have King Neptune's
birthday party here.
她想要海王星国王的
生日聚会在这里。

02:15.176 --> 02:17.679
Ooh, she does, does she?
哦，她愿意，是吗？

02:17.762 --> 02:19.430
I'll handle this, laddie.
我会处理这件事，小伙子。

02:19.514 --> 02:21.975
Yes, Queen Amphitrite.
是的，安菲特里忒女王。

02:23.560 --> 02:25.144
Very convincing,
非常有说服力，

02:25.228 --> 02:26.729
but you'll have to call
pretty early
但你必须打电话
很早

02:26.813 --> 02:28.898
to fool old Eugene Krabs,
为了愚弄老尤金·克拉布斯，

02:28.982 --> 02:30.400
prankster!
恶作剧者！

02:30.483 --> 02:32.318
They think
I was born yesterday.
他们认为
我是昨天出生的。

02:33.903 --> 02:35.446
Whoa!
哇！

02:39.826 --> 02:44.080
Does 7:00 work for you,
your majesty?
7:00 适合你吗？
陛下？

02:44.163 --> 02:45.999
Oil up your spatula, boy,
给你的抹刀加油，孩子，

02:46.082 --> 02:48.668
for tonight,
you fry for a king!
今晚，
你为国王而煎炸！

02:48.751 --> 02:51.588
So much for work without
your hands day, Squarepants.
工作就这么多，没有
你的双手日，方形裤。

02:51.671 --> 02:53.423
You answer to a higher calling
this day.
你响应更高的召唤
这一天。

02:53.506 --> 02:57.176
I have the capability!
我有这个能力！

02:57.260 --> 02:58.845
Okay, that's enough, Patrick.
好吧，够了，帕特里克。

02:58.928 --> 03:00.597
Thank you.
谢谢。

03:03.600 --> 03:05.101
You two really outdid
yourselves.
你们两个真的很优秀
你们自己。

03:05.184 --> 03:06.436
It almost makes me want
to pay you.
这几乎让我想要
付钱给你。

03:08.563 --> 03:10.440
Oh, yeah.
哦，是的。

03:10.523 --> 03:12.984
Looks like this area could use
a few more decorations.
看起来这个区域可以使用
还有一些装饰品。

03:13.067 --> 03:13.985
Squidward!
章鱼哥！

03:14.068 --> 03:15.737
Now what?
现在怎么办？

03:15.820 --> 03:17.739
The decorations over here
look a little sparse.
这里的装饰品
看起来有点稀疏。

03:17.822 --> 03:19.949
Why don't you hang up
a few balloons or something?
你为什么不挂断电话
几个气球什么的？

03:22.076 --> 03:23.119
Oh, that's better.
哦，这样好多了。

03:23.202 --> 03:24.245
Looks lovely, Squidward.
看起来很可爱，章鱼哥。

03:24.329 --> 03:25.413
Excellent work.
佳作。

03:25.496 --> 03:26.456
How goes it over here?
这里进展如何？

03:26.539 --> 03:27.540
All set, Mr. K.
一切准备就绪，K 先生。

03:27.624 --> 03:29.167
5,000 patties,
5,000个肉饼，

03:29.250 --> 03:31.002
one for every year
Neptune's been alive.
每年一个
海王星还活着。

03:31.085 --> 03:33.087
5,000 patties
5,000 个肉饼

03:33.171 --> 03:35.840
at $3.99 a pop?
3.99 美元一支？

03:35.924 --> 03:37.258
400...
400...
400...
400...
400...
400...
400...
400...

03:43.056 --> 03:44.891
Leave it to your old boss here
交给你的老老板吧

03:44.974 --> 03:47.977
to capitalize
on such a momentous occasion.
大写
在如此重要的时刻。

03:51.481 --> 03:52.941
Wow.
哇。

03:53.024 --> 03:55.151
Why, you rolled out
the red carpet.
为什么，你推出了
红地毯。

03:55.234 --> 03:56.402
This ain't for you lot!
这不适合你们！

03:56.486 --> 03:58.279
This is for King Neptune.
这是给海王星国王的。

03:58.363 --> 03:59.697
Today is his birthday.
今天是他的生日。

03:59.781 --> 04:00.949
Oh, wait a minute.
哦，等一下。

04:01.032 --> 04:02.784
King Neptune is coming here?
海王星王要来了？

04:02.867 --> 04:04.953
Oh, I'm a huge fan
of the royal family.
哦，我是个超级粉丝
皇室家族的。

04:05.036 --> 04:07.080
I just love
everything they do.
我就是爱
他们所做的一切。

04:07.163 --> 04:11.084
Oh, could we please
maybe watch them eat?
哦，请问我们可以吗
也许看他们吃饭？

04:11.167 --> 04:13.711
Right here,
through the window, you know?
就在这里，
透过窗户，你知道吗？

04:13.795 --> 04:15.463
Don't be ridiculous.
别开玩笑了。

04:15.546 --> 04:17.715
Why in Neptune's name
would I let you--
为什么以海王星的名义
我能让你——

04:20.009 --> 04:21.928
See Neptune eat!
看海王星吃东西！

04:22.011 --> 04:24.180
Only $5!
只需 5 美元！

04:24.263 --> 04:25.932
Only a few seats left.
只剩下几个座位了。

04:26.015 --> 04:27.141
Thank you.
谢谢。

04:27.225 --> 04:29.102
Thank you.
谢谢。

04:29.185 --> 04:30.353
Do you have change
for a twenty?
你有零钱吗
二十个？

04:30.436 --> 04:31.604
Nope, sorry.
不，抱歉。

04:31.688 --> 04:34.190
Guess it's $20 for you, then.
猜猜你的价格是 20 美元。

04:34.274 --> 04:35.400
Don't be shy, folks.
别害羞，伙计们。

04:35.483 --> 04:36.442
Seats are going fast.
座位抢得很快。

04:47.537 --> 04:50.456
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

04:50.540 --> 04:52.750
Greetings,
my obedient flock.
问候，
我听话的羊群。

04:55.753 --> 04:57.755
You were right, honey.
你是对的，亲爱的。

04:57.839 --> 04:59.465
Hearing these mortals
cheer for me
听到这些凡人的声音
为我欢呼

04:59.549 --> 05:01.467
has made me feel better already.
已经让我感觉好多了。

05:01.551 --> 05:03.428
Excuse me,
Mr. Royal Sea King-ness.
对不起，
皇家海王先生。

05:03.511 --> 05:05.179
Your table is this way, sir.
先生，您的桌子在这边。

05:10.852 --> 05:13.271
These seats
are surprisingly comfortable
这些座位
出奇的舒适

05:13.354 --> 05:16.274
for being no more
than primitive storage vessels.
因为不再存在
比原始的储存容器。

05:16.357 --> 05:19.152
Oh, husband, I'm so glad
to see you're enjoying
哦，老公，我很高兴
看你很享受

05:19.235 --> 05:20.820
your birthday party.
你的生日聚会。

05:20.903 --> 05:24.282
And I am glad
that you're glad, my dear.
我很高兴
你很高兴，亲爱的。

05:24.365 --> 05:27.744
And I'm glad that you're glad
that I'm glad, my King.
我很高兴你高兴
我很高兴，我的国王。

05:27.827 --> 05:29.328
And I'm glad
that you're glad
我很高兴
你很高兴

05:29.412 --> 05:31.205
that I'm glad
that you're glad that--
我很高兴
你很高兴——

05:31.289 --> 05:33.708
All: All right already!
全体：已经好了！

05:33.791 --> 05:36.169
And methinks
I shall continue to enjoy it
我认为
我会继续享受它

05:36.252 --> 05:39.422
so long as there continues
to be no mention of the name--
只要继续存在
不提名字——

05:39.505 --> 05:40.673
Triton?
海卫一？

05:40.757 --> 05:41.674
Triton?
海卫一？

05:41.758 --> 05:42.842
Triton?
海卫一？

05:42.925 --> 05:44.677
Is there a Triton here?
这里有特里同吗？

05:44.761 --> 05:46.054
Is there anybody missing
from this party
有没有人失踪
从这个聚会

05:46.137 --> 05:47.764
that any of you guys can see?
你们中有人能看到吗？

05:47.847 --> 05:48.848
Nope.
There's nobody missing.
没有。
没有人失踪。

05:48.931 --> 05:50.850
We're all here.
我们都在这里。

05:50.933 --> 05:52.602
Oh, I was sure
there's somebody--
哦，我确定
有一个人——

05:52.685 --> 05:54.812
Oh!
哦！

05:54.896 --> 05:56.606
Here it is right here.
就在这里。

05:56.689 --> 05:58.274
An empty seat.
一个空座位。

05:58.357 --> 05:59.442
That's not an empty seat.
那不是一个空座位。

05:59.525 --> 06:01.277
My wife is sitting there.
我妻子坐在那里。

06:02.779 --> 06:04.405
No, not that chair,
your highness.
不，不是那把椅子，
殿下。

06:04.489 --> 06:06.199
That one.
See?
那个。
看？

06:06.282 --> 06:08.326
It even has its pretty name card
that I made still on it.
它甚至还有漂亮的名片
我仍然在上面做的。

06:08.409 --> 06:09.410
Oh, no.
哦，不。

06:09.494 --> 06:11.287
T-R-I-T-O-N.
T-R-I-T-O-N。
T-R-I-T-O-N。
T-R-I-T-O-N。
T-R-I-T-O-N。
T-R-I-T-O-N。
T-R-I-T-O-N。
T-R-I-T-O-N。

06:11.370 --> 06:13.164
You sure you don't know anyone
named Triton?
你确定你不认识任何人
名叫特里同？

06:16.584 --> 06:18.169
Should I put it down
yes or no?
我应该把它放下吗
是还是不是？

06:18.252 --> 06:19.879
Triton is our son.
特里同是我们的儿子。

06:19.962 --> 06:21.839
But as you can see,
但正如你所看到的，

06:21.923 --> 06:24.258
the king doesn't want
to talk about it right now.
国王不想要
现在就谈论它。

06:24.342 --> 06:26.010
Thank you, my darling.
谢谢你，我亲爱的。

06:26.094 --> 06:28.888
I'd rather not share
with this addled mortal
我宁愿不分享
和这个糊涂的凡人

06:28.971 --> 06:31.599
the woeful story of our son,
Triton.
我们儿子的悲惨故事，
海卫一。

06:31.682 --> 06:33.142
Oh, that's probably
a good thing.
哦，那大概是
一件好事。

06:33.226 --> 06:34.977
Yeah, you don't want
to go there.
是的，你不想
去那里。

06:35.061 --> 06:38.606
But I suppose
I could tell it.
但我想
我可以说出来。

06:38.689 --> 06:41.609
No, no, no.
It's fine. It's fine.
不，不，不。
没关系。没关系。

06:41.692 --> 06:43.861
No, you're right.
I won't tell it.
不，你是对的。
我不会告诉它。

06:43.945 --> 06:45.905
Whew.
Good thing too.
呼。
也是好事。

06:45.988 --> 06:48.449
Instead I'm going to show
this 16-millimeter movie
相反，我要展示
这部16毫米电影

06:48.533 --> 06:49.951
I made about it.
我做了这件事。

06:50.034 --> 06:52.078
-Oh.
-Oh, boy.
-哦。
-哦，男孩。

06:52.161 --> 06:54.747
Could someone please
dim the lights?
有人可以吗
把灯调暗？

06:56.833 --> 06:58.835
it all started one day
while giving Triton
这一切都是从某一天开始的
在给予海卫一的同时

06:58.918 --> 07:01.295
his smiting lessons.
他的教训。

07:04.757 --> 07:08.344
That's how you strike fear into
the hearts of your subjects.
这就是你如何让恐惧进入
你的臣民的心。

07:08.427 --> 07:10.596
Now you try, son.
现在你试试吧，儿子。

07:10.680 --> 07:12.265
Son?
儿子？

07:12.348 --> 07:14.183
Triton was increasingly
fascinated
海卫一越来越
着迷的

07:14.267 --> 07:17.436
with the miserable world
of the lowly mortals.
与悲惨的世界
属于卑微的凡人。

07:17.520 --> 07:20.273
Dad, when are you gonna teach
me the ball and stick game?
爸爸，你什么时候上课？
我玩球棒游戏吗？

07:20.356 --> 07:22.108
Never.
绝不。

07:22.191 --> 07:24.819
Now, take hold of your trident
and practice your smiting, son.
现在，拿起你的三叉戟
儿子，练习你的击打。

07:24.902 --> 07:26.404
I don't feel like smiting.
我不想打。

07:26.487 --> 07:28.239
I want to play
the ball and stick game.
我想玩
球棒游戏。

07:28.322 --> 07:29.782
Okay, son.
好吧，儿子。

07:29.866 --> 07:31.534
You want to learn
the stick and ball game?
你想学习
棍子和球游戏？

07:31.617 --> 07:33.494
Well, here's your first lesson.
好吧，这是你的第一课。

07:33.578 --> 07:36.622
Batter up.
击打。

07:38.249 --> 07:41.127
it looks like I just hit
a single.
看起来我刚刚打了
一个。

07:41.210 --> 07:43.838
Let's see if you can get
a home run, son.
让我们看看你是否能得到
儿子，全垒打。

07:43.921 --> 07:46.299
Leave me alone, Dad.
别管我了，爸爸。

07:46.382 --> 07:50.011
What was happening
to my own flesh and blood?
发生了什么事
为了我自己的骨肉？

07:50.094 --> 07:52.096
Over the next few millennia,
在接下来的几千年里，

07:52.180 --> 07:54.432
my son grew not only in size
我的儿子不仅长大了

07:54.515 --> 07:57.185
but in perplexing behavior.
但行为令人困惑。

08:02.607 --> 08:04.567
What is going on in here?
这里发生了什么事？

08:04.650 --> 08:06.068
Hey, Dad, check it out!
嘿，爸爸，看看吧！

08:06.152 --> 08:08.029
I'm studying chemistry,
我是学化学的

08:08.112 --> 08:12.158
and I've just created a cure
for all mortal diseases.
我刚刚发明了一种治疗方法
对于所有致命的疾病。

08:13.784 --> 08:15.745
how many times
do I have to tell you?
多少次
我必须告诉你吗？

08:15.828 --> 08:17.538
We are Gods!
我们是神！

08:17.622 --> 08:19.415
We don't have diseases,
我们没有疾病，

08:19.498 --> 08:23.628
nor do we care whether or not
the mortals contract them.
我们也不关心是否
凡人与他们签订契约。

08:23.711 --> 08:25.588
Gosh!
天哪！

08:25.671 --> 08:27.215
Try as I might,
尽我所能去尝试，

08:27.298 --> 08:29.133
it was becoming
increasingly apparent
它正在成为
越来越明显

08:29.217 --> 08:32.178
that we would not agree
on the ways of the world.
我们不会同意
关于世界的方式。

08:32.261 --> 08:34.263
I knew I had no choice.
我知道我别无选择。

08:34.347 --> 08:36.933
There was only one last resort.
只有最后一招了。

08:38.434 --> 08:39.852
No, not that one.
不，不是那个。

08:39.936 --> 08:42.188
The island in the sky.
天空中的岛屿。

08:42.271 --> 08:44.232
Isn't that island
a miniature golf course?
那个岛不是吗
迷你高尔夫球场？

08:44.315 --> 08:45.983
No!
不！

08:46.067 --> 08:48.402
The one on the other side
of the river.
另一边的那个
河的。

08:48.486 --> 08:50.738
You mean the juvenile
correction facility?
你说的是少年
矫正设施？

08:50.821 --> 08:52.865
But that place
is for losers, man.
但那个地方
是为失败者准备的，伙计。

08:52.949 --> 08:54.951
Uh-huh.
嗯嗯。

08:55.034 --> 08:56.869
Okay, I'm standing in here.
好吧，我就站在这里。

08:56.953 --> 08:58.913
Now what?
现在怎么办？

08:58.996 --> 09:00.873
What are you doing?
你在干什么？

09:00.957 --> 09:02.917
This is bogus.
这是假的。

09:03.000 --> 09:07.129
I'm sealing you inside
this magical shrinking cage
我将你封印在里面
这个神奇的缩小笼子

09:07.213 --> 09:10.383
until you learn
to embrace your destiny
直到你学会
去拥抱你的命运

09:10.466 --> 09:13.594
as one of the gods.
作为众神之一。

09:13.678 --> 09:16.889
No!
不！

09:16.973 --> 09:19.725
You call that shrinking?
你管这叫收缩？

09:19.809 --> 09:21.936
Well, it only shrinks 7%.
嗯，它只缩小了 7%。

09:22.019 --> 09:24.563
Man,
that is just beyond bogus.
伙计，
这简直就是假的。

09:24.647 --> 09:27.108
Perhaps in your eyes,
it is beyond bogus,
也许在你眼里，
它超越了虚假，

09:27.191 --> 09:29.068
but it is the only way
you'll learn.
但这是唯一的方法
你会学到的。

09:29.151 --> 09:33.114
Reflect on this
for 10,000 years.
反思这一点
一万年。

09:33.197 --> 09:34.907
You can't do this, man.
你不能这样做，伙计。

09:34.991 --> 09:36.784
I've got a life to live.
我还有生活要过。

09:36.867 --> 09:39.287
I can't be stuck
in this cage, man!
我不能被困住
在这个笼子里，伙计！

09:39.370 --> 09:40.830
God.
上帝。

09:40.913 --> 09:42.456
I hate you, old man!
You hear me?
我恨你，老家伙！
你听到了吗？

09:42.540 --> 09:43.749
I hate you!
我恨你！

09:45.418 --> 09:48.296
Oh!
哦！

09:48.379 --> 09:50.381
And that's that.
就是这样。

09:56.887 --> 09:58.556
Huh?
啊？

09:58.639 --> 10:02.268
Okay, who's ready
for a piping hot Krabby Patty?
好吧，谁准备好了
想要吃滚烫的蟹肉饼吗？

10:02.351 --> 10:04.437
Would you like the first one,
your highness?
你想要第一个吗
殿下？

10:04.520 --> 10:07.189
Recounting this sad tale
has upset me so much,
讲述这个悲伤的故事
让我非常心烦意乱，

10:07.273 --> 10:09.775
I've lost my appetite.
我失去了胃口。

10:11.110 --> 10:13.237
Take those sandwiches away.
把那些三明治拿走。

10:13.321 --> 10:15.990
Can't you see
the king is upset?
你看不到吗
国王不高兴了？

10:16.073 --> 10:17.074
It's okay.
没关系。

10:17.158 --> 10:18.534
Let it out.
把它放出来。

10:18.617 --> 10:20.286
This is a rip-off!
这是一个敲诈勒索！

10:20.369 --> 10:23.205
I paid to watch high-class
royal dining action,
我付费观看高级节目
皇家用餐行动，

10:23.289 --> 10:25.249
not listen to a boring
sob story.
不听无聊的
哭泣的故事。

10:25.333 --> 10:27.752
Ooh, looks like things
may be picking up.
哦，看起来像东西
可能正在回升。

10:27.835 --> 10:30.212
Royal violence!
皇室暴力！

10:30.296 --> 10:32.423
Why have you not obeyed me,
mortal?
为什么你不听我的话，
凡人？

10:32.506 --> 10:33.966
Begone!
走开！

10:34.050 --> 10:35.634
So who's gonna pay
for these, then?
那么谁来付钱
对于这些，那么呢？

10:35.718 --> 10:37.303
Zap!
噗！

10:38.888 --> 10:40.222
If Neptune
doesn't cheer up soon,
如果海王星
还不快高兴起来

10:40.306 --> 10:43.726
me business is ruined.
我的生意毁了。

10:43.809 --> 10:45.394
Oh, no.
哦，不。

10:45.478 --> 10:47.063
This is all my fault
because I mentioned...
这都是我的错
因为我提到...

10:48.898 --> 10:51.108
Well, it wouldn't be the first
time you've ruined everything,
嗯，这不会是第一个
当你毁掉一切的时候

10:51.192 --> 10:53.319
but the worst part
is those 5,000 Krabby Patties
但最糟糕的部分
就是那 5,000 个蟹黄饼

10:53.402 --> 10:55.446
that will end up going rotten
in the hot sun.
那最终会腐烂
在烈日下。

10:55.529 --> 10:57.156
Stop, Squidward!
Please stop!
停下来，章鱼哥！
请停下来！

10:57.239 --> 10:58.407
Your descriptions
are too horrifying
您的描述
太恐怖了

10:58.491 --> 11:00.242
for my delicate sensibilities.
为了我脆弱的情感。

11:00.326 --> 11:01.827
I do have a way with words.
我确实有一套用词的方法。

11:01.911 --> 11:04.955
Oh, how I miss my son!
哦，我多么想念我的儿子啊！

11:06.791 --> 11:08.542
Hey, that's it!
嘿，就是这样！

11:08.626 --> 11:11.379
I'll fix all this by reuniting
Neptune with his son.
我会通过重聚来解决这一切
海王星和他的儿子。

11:18.761 --> 11:21.263
Thanks again,
Mr. Bus driver!
再次感谢，
公交车司机先生！

11:21.347 --> 11:25.684
Now, all I've got to do is find
King Neptune's long-lost son.
现在我要做的就是找到
海王星国王失散多年的儿子。

11:30.648 --> 11:32.692
Come on, Krabs.
Think! Think!
来吧，蟹蟹们。
思考！思考！

11:33.984 --> 11:35.194
Ooh!
哦！

11:35.277 --> 11:37.154
Whatever it is,
no.
不管是什么，
不。

11:37.238 --> 11:40.574
Squidward,
you're a man of culture.
章鱼哥，
你是一个有文化的人。

11:40.658 --> 11:42.535
Go on.
继续。

11:42.618 --> 11:45.037
Well, these highfalutin types,
they--
嗯，这些高调的类型，
他们——

11:45.121 --> 11:47.164
They might appreciate that,
don't you think?
他们可能会感激，
你不觉得吗？

11:47.248 --> 11:49.542
Why don't you try
and razzle-dazzle 'em
你为什么不尝试一下
让他们眼花缭乱

11:49.625 --> 11:52.211
with all your pizzazz?
与你所有的活力？

11:52.294 --> 11:54.713
Pizzazz.
活力四射。

11:54.797 --> 11:57.091
Hold on to your hats
and glasses, people,
抓紧你的帽子
还有眼镜、人、

11:57.174 --> 12:02.847
because Squidward
the fantabulous has arrived.
因为章鱼哥
奇妙的事情已经到来。

12:02.930 --> 12:04.640
Thank you, thank you.
谢谢，谢谢。

12:04.723 --> 12:06.308
This next one,
I wrote myself.
这下一篇，
我自己写的。

12:06.392 --> 12:09.311
I like to call it
Three Barnacles Are a Crowd
我喜欢这样称呼它
三只藤壶是一群

12:09.395 --> 12:11.689
Unless They've Known Each Other
For a Really Long Time.
除非他们彼此认识
很长一段时间。

12:11.772 --> 12:12.940
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

12:13.023 --> 12:15.192
Things just got lame again.
事情又变得蹩脚了。

12:15.276 --> 12:17.153
Yeah, well, they better get
un-lame real quick,
是的，好吧，他们最好得到
很快就不再瘸了，

12:17.236 --> 12:18.988
or I'm asking
for my money back.
或者我问
为了我的钱回来。

12:21.490 --> 12:23.117
No refunds?
没有退款吗？

12:23.200 --> 12:25.744
Well, I guess
we're stuck here, then.
嗯，我猜
那么我们就被困在这里了。

12:31.417 --> 12:33.085
What the--
什么是——

12:33.169 --> 12:35.087
I had the strangest dream
that I just got hit in the head
我做了一个最奇怪的梦
我的头刚刚被击中

12:35.171 --> 12:37.381
with a tiny toenail clipping.
用一个小脚趾甲剪。

12:37.465 --> 12:38.424
Oh!
哦！

12:38.507 --> 12:39.675
Hey, I was right.
嘿，我是对的。

12:39.758 --> 12:42.219
It is a tiny toenail clipping.
这是一个很小的脚趾甲剪。

12:47.141 --> 12:48.225
Another one.
另一个。

12:48.309 --> 12:50.352
Plus some rope.
加上一些绳子。

12:55.691 --> 12:57.651
Hey, man.
What's the big idea?
嘿，伙计。
有什么大创意？

12:57.735 --> 12:58.777
Who said that?
谁说的？

12:58.861 --> 12:59.820
Show yourself!
展示你自己！

12:59.904 --> 13:00.946
I'm warning you.
我警告你。

13:01.030 --> 13:02.490
I know how to use these.
我知道如何使用这些。

13:02.573 --> 13:03.657
Whah! Whah! Whah!
Whah!
哇！哇！哇！
哇！

13:03.741 --> 13:06.577
I'm down here, man.
我在这儿，伙计。

13:06.660 --> 13:08.454
Oh, hello,
little fellow.
哦，你好，
小家伙。

13:08.537 --> 13:09.997
Maybe you can help me.
也许你可以帮助我。

13:10.080 --> 13:11.874
'Cause if I don't
find Triton soon,
因为如果我不这样做
很快就能找到海卫一，

13:11.957 --> 13:13.959
Mr. Krabs
is gonna be real upset,
蟹老板先生
真的会很沮丧

13:14.043 --> 13:16.795
because he spent a lot of money
on party decorations.
因为他花了很多钱
在派对装饰品上。

13:16.879 --> 13:18.380
Party decorations?
派对装饰品？

13:18.464 --> 13:19.715
For what?
为了什么？

13:19.798 --> 13:21.467
For King Neptune's birthday.
为了庆祝海王星国王的生日。

13:21.550 --> 13:23.469
So it's my old man's
birthday.
所以这是我老人家的
生日。

13:23.552 --> 13:25.137
Big deal.
有什么大不了的。

13:27.223 --> 13:30.392
You mean
you're King Neptune's son?
你的意思是
你是海王星国王的儿子？

13:30.476 --> 13:31.936
I am,
我是，

13:32.019 --> 13:33.354
but he doesn't seem
to think so.
但他似乎并不
这么认为。

13:33.437 --> 13:34.939
Well, he sure seemed upset
嗯，他看起来确实很沮丧

13:35.022 --> 13:36.649
that you weren't
at his birthday party.
你不是
在他的生日聚会上。

13:36.732 --> 13:37.816
Ha!
That's a real good one, man.
哈!
这真是一件好事，伙计。

13:37.900 --> 13:39.235
Real funny.
真有趣。

13:40.569 --> 13:42.112
well, thanks, but I was just--
好吧，谢谢，但我只是——

13:42.196 --> 13:44.031
Do you think if that old goat
really cared,
你认为如果那只老山羊
真的很关心，

13:44.114 --> 13:46.116
he'd have me sealed up here
in this magical cage
他会把我封印在这里
在这个神奇的牢笼里

13:46.200 --> 13:48.786
with nothing to do all day
but trim my fingernails, man?
整天无所事事
但是修剪我的指甲吗，伙计？

13:48.869 --> 13:50.287
You're right.
你说得对。

13:50.371 --> 13:51.914
It just doesn't make
any sense.
它只是不让
任何意义。

13:51.997 --> 13:53.999
You're telling me, man.
你在告诉我，伙计。

13:54.083 --> 13:56.794
I mean, gods shouldn't have
to use nail clippers.
我的意思是，神不应该
使用指甲刀。

13:56.877 --> 13:58.546
They should be able
to will their fingernails
他们应该能够
修剪指甲

13:58.629 --> 14:00.172
to whatever length they want.
无论他们想要什么长度。

14:00.256 --> 14:03.092
Man, you're just like
all the rest.
伙计，你就像
其余的一切。

14:03.175 --> 14:05.344
Don't go.
别走。

14:07.304 --> 14:08.681
What if I there was a way
to free you
如果我有办法怎么办
释放你

14:08.764 --> 14:10.558
from this magical cage?
来自这个神奇的笼子？

14:10.641 --> 14:12.643
Then you could come
to your father's birthday party
那么你可以来
去你父亲的生日聚会

14:12.726 --> 14:14.395
and settle your differences.
并解决你们的分歧。

14:14.478 --> 14:17.314
Then I'd ask you to brush
your teeth first, dude.
那我就请你刷
首先你的牙齿，伙计。

14:17.398 --> 14:19.233
Pee-yew!
尿尿！

14:19.316 --> 14:21.652
Sorry, I haven't had anything
to drink in a couple days.
抱歉，我什么都没有
几天后喝。

14:21.735 --> 14:23.529
My throat's a little dry.
我的喉咙有点干。

14:24.863 --> 14:27.199
This cage is only so big, man.
这个笼子就这么大，伙计。

14:27.283 --> 14:28.576
I'm sorry.
对不起。

14:28.659 --> 14:30.411
I'll stop talking.
I swear.
我就不说话了
我发誓。

14:30.494 --> 14:31.537
Never mind.
没关系。

14:31.620 --> 14:33.205
Just undo the lock.
只要解开锁就可以了。

14:33.289 --> 14:35.291
Boy, this really does
look complicated.
男孩，这确实是
看起来很复杂。

14:35.374 --> 14:36.917
Oh, I see.
我懂了。

14:37.001 --> 14:38.669
I'll just slide this square
to the right.
我只需滑动这个方块
到右边。

14:38.752 --> 14:39.795
This one goes up.
这个就涨了

14:39.878 --> 14:40.879
This one over here.
这边这个。

14:40.963 --> 14:42.673
And--no, wait.
还有——不，等等。

14:42.756 --> 14:43.674
No.
不。

14:43.757 --> 14:45.384
No.
不。

14:45.467 --> 14:47.177
No.
不。

14:51.348 --> 14:53.225
Man, that really is
a tough nut to crack.
伙计，这确实是
一个棘手的问题。

14:53.309 --> 14:56.061
That lock was forged
by the gods!
那把锁是伪造的
天哪！

14:56.145 --> 14:58.063
Not just any numbskull
can open it
不只是任何麻木的人
可以打开它

14:58.147 --> 14:59.898
like it's some cheap bag
of potato chips
就像是一些便宜的包
薯片

14:59.982 --> 15:01.442
they found in the street.
他们在街上发现的。

15:01.525 --> 15:04.236
Cheap bag of potato chi--
便宜一袋土豆气--

15:04.320 --> 15:05.654
Wait a minute!
等一下！

15:05.738 --> 15:07.281
Which way to the nearest
phone booth?
去哪条路最近
电话亭？

15:07.364 --> 15:08.657
There's one behind that rock
over there,
那块石头后面有一个
在那儿，

15:08.741 --> 15:10.951
but I don't see what--
但我不明白是什么——

15:11.035 --> 15:12.161
Hello,
Patrick?
你好，
帕特里克？

15:12.244 --> 15:13.787
Hey! Hey!
嘿！嘿！

15:13.871 --> 15:16.999
You'll never guess what I found
today in the street--
你永远猜不到我发现了什么
今天在街上——

15:17.082 --> 15:19.001
Yeah, I'll hurry.
是的，我会快点。

15:25.799 --> 15:27.384
Oh, Patrick, you made it.
哦，帕特里克，你成功了。

15:27.468 --> 15:29.803
This is that magical lock
I was telling you about.
这就是那把神奇的锁
我正在告诉你有关。

15:29.887 --> 15:31.305
Hmm.
唔。

15:31.388 --> 15:32.931
Yeah, I tried it
for hours and hours,
是的，我尝试过
几个小时又几个小时，

15:33.015 --> 15:35.100
but I just can't get it to--
但我就是做不到——

15:35.184 --> 15:37.186
Open!
Wow, already?
打开！
哇，已经了吗？

15:37.269 --> 15:39.021
Patrick, you know,
I'll never figure out
帕特里克，你知道，
我永远不会明白

15:39.104 --> 15:40.356
how you're able to do those
so darn fast.
你如何能够做到这些
太快了。

15:40.439 --> 15:41.815
It's easy.
这很容易。

15:41.899 --> 15:43.484
I just peel the stickers
off the squares
我只是撕掉贴纸
远离方块

15:43.567 --> 15:45.569
and put 'em down
where they're supposed to go.
并把它们放下
他们应该去的地方。

15:45.653 --> 15:47.154
Amazing!
惊人的！

15:47.237 --> 15:49.657
Well, now that this
silly old cage is open,
好吧，既然这个
愚蠢的旧笼子打开了，

15:49.740 --> 15:53.202
what do you say
we go pay my old man a visit?
你说什么
我们去拜访我的老人吗？

15:53.285 --> 15:56.205
Hate to keep him waiting
on his birthday.
讨厌让他等
在他生日那天。

16:02.920 --> 16:04.755
Well, you guys coming
or what?
嗯，你们来了
或者什么？

16:04.838 --> 16:06.173
Wow.
哇。

16:06.256 --> 16:07.508
Are you gonna take us
for a ride?
你要带我们去吗
搭车？

16:07.591 --> 16:08.634
A ride.
一趟。

16:08.717 --> 16:10.803
That's a great idea.
这是个好主意。

16:14.682 --> 16:15.641
Both: Oh!
两人：哦！

16:25.359 --> 16:26.652
Hey, you guys don't mind
if I pull over here
嘿嘿，你们不介意吧
如果我把车停在这里

16:26.735 --> 16:27.695
for a second, do you?
等一下，你呢？

16:27.778 --> 16:29.196
Sure, Triton.
当然，特里同。

16:29.279 --> 16:30.989
What do you need to do,
use the bathroom?
你需要做什么，
使用浴室吗？

16:31.073 --> 16:34.201
No, to tell you
I don't need you anymore.
不，告诉你
我不再需要你了。

16:37.246 --> 16:40.582
What an interesting man.
多么有趣的一个人啊。

16:40.666 --> 16:43.585
Ready for a room temperature
Krabby Patty yet?
准备好室温
蟹蟹帕蒂还没来吗？

16:43.669 --> 16:44.670
Nope.
没有。

16:47.423 --> 16:48.632
Careful.
小心。

16:48.716 --> 16:50.384
This is made of imported wood.
这是由进口木材制成的。

16:50.467 --> 16:52.511
Imported all the way
from that junk pile out back.
全程进口
从后面的垃圾堆里。

16:52.594 --> 16:54.471
Neptune's inconsolable.
海王星伤心欲绝。

16:54.555 --> 16:57.182
Maybe if there was something
to distract him from his pain.
也许如果有什么
以分散他对痛苦的注意力。

16:57.266 --> 16:59.184
Well, the only thing
that can usually do that
嗯，唯一的事情
通常可以做到这一点

16:59.268 --> 17:01.812
is something that hurts more
than the original pain.
是更伤人的事
比原来的痛苦。

17:01.895 --> 17:02.938
Great idea.
好主意。

17:03.021 --> 17:05.107
Go play 'em another song.
去给他们再唱一首歌吧。

17:07.484 --> 17:09.361
He's back.
他回来了。

17:09.445 --> 17:10.904
Oh.
哦。

17:10.988 --> 17:13.490
How...nice?
多么……好？

17:13.574 --> 17:15.159
If it pleases the King,
如果国王高兴的话

17:15.242 --> 17:16.869
I would like to perform a--
我想表演一个——

17:22.416 --> 17:23.292
What the--
什么是——

17:23.375 --> 17:24.543
Behold!
看哪！

17:24.626 --> 17:26.170
What'd he say?
他说什么？

17:26.253 --> 17:29.465
I think he wants us
to look out the-- Oh, my!
我想他想要我们
留意——哦，天哪！

17:32.926 --> 17:34.970
That was incredible!
太不可思议了！

17:35.053 --> 17:37.264
Yeah, definitely worth
the 5 bucks.
是的，绝对值得
5块钱。

17:37.347 --> 17:39.433
Son?
儿子？

17:42.644 --> 17:45.063
Son, I demand to know
the meaning
儿子，我想知道
意义

17:45.147 --> 17:47.566
of this impudent imprisonment.
这种无礼的监禁。

17:47.649 --> 17:50.068
Well, it turns out
you were right, old man.
好吧，事实证明
你是对的，老人。

17:50.152 --> 17:52.404
Being trapped in that cage
all those years
被困在那个笼子里
那些年

17:52.488 --> 17:54.740
with nowhere to go
but up in here
无处可去
但在这里

17:54.823 --> 17:56.575
made me realize something.
让我意识到一些事情。

17:56.658 --> 17:58.911
Dabbling in the world
of mere mortals
涉足世界
凡人的

17:58.994 --> 18:02.080
is totally lame.
完全是蹩脚的。

18:02.164 --> 18:04.875
And this is how you intend
to show it?
这就是你的意图
来展示它？

18:04.958 --> 18:05.876
No, man.
不，伙计。

18:05.959 --> 18:07.795
This is how!
就是这样！

18:10.839 --> 18:14.134
By flying through the roof?
飞过屋顶？

18:14.218 --> 18:16.386
That was Triton,
Neptune's son.
那是特里同，
海王星的儿子。

18:16.470 --> 18:18.514
I thought he was
in reform school or something.
我以为他是
在改革学校什么的。

18:20.891 --> 18:22.559
Hey, can I have an autograph?
嘿，我可以要个签名吗？

18:22.643 --> 18:24.603
Sure, you can.
当然，你可以。

18:35.364 --> 18:36.782
Nothing can stop me!
没有什么可以阻止我！

18:43.288 --> 18:46.792
What's happened here?
这里发生了什么事？

18:46.875 --> 18:49.586
Hello?
你好？

18:49.670 --> 18:51.338
Where is everybody?
大家都在哪里？

18:51.421 --> 18:54.800
Do you think maybe Triton
was in that cage for a reason?
你认为也许 Triton
被关在笼子里是有原因的吗？

18:57.719 --> 18:59.054
It's still standing.
它仍然站着。

18:59.137 --> 19:00.597
But look.
但你看。

19:00.681 --> 19:01.890
That mail hasn't been
picked up today.
那封邮件还没有
今天捡到的。

19:01.974 --> 19:03.475
You're right.
你说得对。

19:03.559 --> 19:05.894
We'd better use
the secret entrance.
我们最好用
秘密入口。

19:05.978 --> 19:07.688
Be very, very quiet.
保持非常非常安静。

19:07.771 --> 19:09.815
Got you, pal.
明白你了，朋友。

19:14.987 --> 19:16.405
What?
什么？

19:21.451 --> 19:22.202
Please!
请！

19:22.286 --> 19:23.662
I'll be ruined.
我会被毁掉的。

19:23.745 --> 19:25.205
Don't worry, Mr. Krabs.
别担心，蟹老板。

19:25.289 --> 19:26.999
No one was going
to pay for them anyway.
没有人去
无论如何都要付钱给他们。

19:29.293 --> 19:31.545
Oh, this is terrible.
哦，这太可怕了。

19:31.628 --> 19:32.838
Tell me about it.
告诉我吧。

19:32.921 --> 19:34.715
I never get free food here.
我在这里从来没有得到过免费食物。

19:34.798 --> 19:36.174
Son, hear my words.
儿子，听我的话。

19:36.258 --> 19:37.843
I can understand if you want
如果你愿意的话我可以理解

19:37.926 --> 19:40.512
to keep me locked up
in this cage and zap me,
把我锁起来
在这个笼子里并攻击我，

19:40.596 --> 19:42.973
but see it in your heart
to release these others,
但在你心里看到它
释放这些其他人，

19:43.056 --> 19:45.517
for they are innocent.
因为他们是无辜的。

19:45.601 --> 19:48.854
Well, maybe not all of them.
好吧，也许不是全部。

19:48.937 --> 19:50.355
Sorry, old man.
对不起，老头子。

19:50.439 --> 19:52.816
You lost me
at the "hear my words" part.
你失去了我
在“听我的话”部分。

19:52.900 --> 19:54.401
He's unstoppable.
他势不可挡。

19:54.484 --> 19:56.194
Only as long as King Neptune
is locked up.
只要海王星国王
被锁定。

19:56.278 --> 19:58.030
Are you thinking
what I'm thinking?
你在想吗
我在想什么？

19:58.113 --> 20:00.699
Yeah, triple goo-berry sundaes
tonight after we free 'em?
是的，三重浆果圣代
今晚我们释放他们之后？

20:00.782 --> 20:03.035
No, but I like your idea
better!
不，但我喜欢你的想法
更好！

20:03.118 --> 20:05.203
Make ready the disguise.
准备好伪装。

20:08.040 --> 20:09.207
Okay. Now.
好的。现在。

20:09.291 --> 20:10.918
No! Please!
不！请！

20:11.001 --> 20:12.544
No more!
不再！

20:12.628 --> 20:13.837
Quick, Patrick.
快点，帕特里克。

20:13.921 --> 20:14.880
Unlock it before he sees us.
在他看到我们之前解锁它。

20:14.963 --> 20:17.382
You got it.
你明白了。

20:17.466 --> 20:20.135
Spongebob,
scooch back a little.
海绵宝宝，
向后退一点。

20:20.218 --> 20:21.136
Excuse me.
打扰一下。

20:21.219 --> 20:23.597
Okay, got it.
好的，明白了。

20:23.680 --> 20:24.932
You better hurry it up,
Patrick.
你最好快点
帕特里克.

20:25.015 --> 20:25.974
He's getting bored.
他越来越无聊了。

20:26.058 --> 20:27.017
Don't rush me!
别催我！

20:27.100 --> 20:28.018
Okay, got it!
好的，明白了！

20:28.101 --> 20:30.312
Zap!
噗！

20:34.483 --> 20:36.234
I was just kidding, man.
我只是开玩笑，伙计。

20:41.114 --> 20:42.282
No.
No, please.
不。
不，请。

20:42.366 --> 20:43.951
I never meant to--
我从来没想过——

20:44.034 --> 20:47.287
Son, I have tried all my life
to be gentle,
儿子，我一生都在努力
要温柔，

20:47.371 --> 20:50.249
but this time, you have--
但这一次，你——

20:56.672 --> 21:01.426
Are you responsible
for all this destruction?
你有责任吗
为了这一切的破坏？

21:01.510 --> 21:03.136
Don't send me back
别送我回来

21:03.220 --> 21:04.763
I-I-I--
我-我-我--

21:04.846 --> 21:06.181
The cage?
笼子？

21:06.264 --> 21:08.392
Why, son,
you've just given me
为什么，儿子，
你刚刚给了我

21:08.475 --> 21:11.061
the best
5,000th birthday present
最好的
5,000 岁生日礼物

21:11.144 --> 21:13.355
I've ever received!
我曾经收到过！

21:13.438 --> 21:17.317
You've finally learned
to use your god powers.
你终于学会了
使用你的神的力量。

21:17.401 --> 21:20.278
Now I know that when my reign
comes to a close,
现在我知道当我统治时
即将结束，

21:20.362 --> 21:22.739
I will have a worthy successor,
我将有一位称职的继任者，

21:22.823 --> 21:27.452
and that's really all I could
ever hope for as a king...
这就是我所能做的一切
永远希望成为国王...

21:29.496 --> 21:31.206
Come here, you.
过来吧，你。

21:31.289 --> 21:33.792
Aw, Dad.
I love you, man.
噢，爸爸。
我爱你，伙计。

21:36.586 --> 21:37.921
Huzzah!
好哇！

21:38.005 --> 21:39.214
Yay!
耶！

21:39.298 --> 21:40.799
Whoo-hoo!
Yeah!
呼呼！
是的！

21:40.882 --> 21:42.175
Hurray!
Whoo!
欢呼！
呼！

21:42.259 --> 21:43.468
Celebrate!
庆祝！

21:43.552 --> 21:45.971
Now let's go home, son.
现在我们回家吧，儿子。

21:49.057 --> 21:50.225
Toodle-oo!
嘟嘟哦！

21:54.021 --> 21:55.313
Neptune and friends, wait!
海王星和朋友们，等等！

21:55.397 --> 21:56.857
What about the party?
聚会呢？

21:56.940 --> 21:58.817
What about me restaurant?
我的餐厅呢？

21:58.900 --> 22:00.277
Ah, yes!
啊，是的！

22:00.360 --> 22:02.487
Many thanks,
whoever you are!
非常感谢，
不管你是谁！

22:02.571 --> 22:05.490
It was the best birthday
I could ever have hoped for,
这是最棒的生日
我本来可以希望，

22:05.574 --> 22:08.827
and it's all because
of your little employee there.
这都是因为
你的小雇员在那里。

22:08.910 --> 22:11.663
None of this would have happened
if it wasn't for his actions.
这一切都不会发生
如果不是他的行为。

22:13.331 --> 22:14.791
Did you hear that?
你听到了吗？

22:14.875 --> 22:18.086
Neptune said this
was all because of me.
海王星这样说
都是因为我。

22:18.170 --> 22:19.421
Well, Spongebob, that's--
嗯，海绵宝宝，那是——

22:19.504 --> 22:21.298
Did you hear that?
你听到了吗？

22:21.381 --> 22:23.884
Neptune said this was all
because of that guy.
海王星说这就是全部
因为那个家伙。

22:23.967 --> 22:25.302
He did, did he?
他做到了，是吗？

22:25.385 --> 22:26.386
Uh, Spongebob?
呃，海绵宝宝？

22:26.470 --> 22:27.929
Yes, Patrick?
是的，帕特里克？

22:28.013 --> 22:29.681
Do you think right now
might be a good time
你现在认为
可能是个好时机

22:29.765 --> 22:31.099
to go get those
triple goo-berry sundaes
去拿那些
三重粘浆果圣代

22:31.183 --> 22:32.726
you were talking about?
你在说什么？

22:32.809 --> 22:34.686
I think right now
might be an excellent time.
我想现在
也许是一段美好的时光。

22:49.451 --> 22:57.084
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

♪ ♪